                "paragraphs": [
                    "Founded with a vision to transform lives across Uganda, Tattu Care works directly with communities to address their most pressing needs. Every two months, we organize collection drives and distribute essential resources to those who need them most.",
                    "Our approach is holistic - we don't just provide temporary relief, but work on sustainable solutions that empower communities to thrive independently."
                ]
            },
            {
                "image": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1532629345422-7515f3d16bb6?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1470&q=80",
                "paragraphs": [
                    "Our volunteer network spans across rural Uganda. Local coordinators, community leaders, and donors all play a vital role in reaching the families who need us most.",
                    "Every shilling, every box of supplies, and every hour of volunteer time is documented and reported back so our donors see the difference they made."
                ]
            }
        ]
